atus --short package.json` \\u2014 must print **nothing**. `package.json` has no changes vs HEAD; if it appears in the commit, the commit was built wrong.\\n4. `git status --short -- src/api/modules/efforts.js src/components/global_settings/EffortsSettings.vue tests/effortsApi.test.mjs` \\u2014 must print **nothing** (all three committed).\\n5. Confirm these were **NOT** committed: `src/components/kanban/TaskSettings.vue`, `src/api/modules/browsers.js`, `src/api/modules/computers.js`, `tests/responseOptions.test.mjs`, `tests/voiceBargeIn.test.mjs`.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- A write-up on this card stating, per check, **pass or fail with the command output pasted**.\\n- If any check fails: move this card to `Working`, comment the failure verbatim, and **do not** attempt a fix \\u2014 that is the commit owner's call, not this card's.\\n- If the commit did **not** happen at all: say so plainly and ping `0bc8b144`; the go/no-go at 11-20 16:00Z must not proceed on an uncommitted tree.\\n\\n## Out of scope\\n\\nEditing files, amending commits, rebasing, pushing. Read-only verification.\",\n    \"message_count\": 11\n  }\n}",
          "output": "### Task `post-commit verification: confirm the 3-path efforts commit actually landed and nothing extra went in`\n- ID: `f48294e8-0852-44c1-9eea-a4b46b0f1983`\n- Status: `doing` | Mode: `chat`\n- Board: `IT team` | Column: `Working`\n- Sprints: none\n- Priority: `high` | Progress: 60% | Due: `2026-11-19` | Wake: `2026-11-23T09:00:00+00:00`\n- Assignees: software_developer\n- Updated: 2026-11-20T13:09:14.886183\n- Description: ## Why this card exists (PM, shift 6, 2026-11-19T09:30Z)\n\nThe gate `8eded3ebb` runs at **12:00Z** and the commit `0bc8b144` at **13:00Z**. Nothing runs between the commit and the go/no-go at 11-20 16:00Z (`8eded1c4`). If the 13:00Z commit silently fails, half-commits or picks up an extra path, **management decides go/no-go on a tree that is not what the report says it is.**\n\nThis card is the missing verification. It writes no code \u2014 it only reads git state and reports.\n\n## What to do (in the project root / repo root)\n\n1. `git log --oneline -3` \u2014 confirm a commit exists dated **2026-11-19** with a message mentioning the efforts delete fix.\n2. `git show --stat HEAD` \u2014 confirm **exactly 3 paths**:\n   - `src/api/modules/efforts.js` (~+8/-3)\n   - `src/components/global_settings/EffortsSettings.vue` (~+8/-1)\n   - `tests/effortsApi.test.mjs` (~+3/-5)\n3. `git status --short package.json` \u2014 must print **nothing**. `package.json` has no changes vs HEAD; if it appears in the commit, the commit was built wrong.\n4. `git status --short -- src/api/modules/efforts.js src/components/global_settings/EffortsSettings.vue tests/effortsApi.test.mjs` \u2014 must print **nothing** (all three committed).\n5. Confirm these were **NOT** committed: `src/components/kanban/TaskSettings.vue`, `src/api/modules/browsers.js`, `src/api/modules/computers.js`, `tests/responseOptions.test.mjs`, `tests/voiceBargeIn.test.mjs`.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A write-up on this card stating, per check, **pass or fail with the command output